    {
      "id": "q.math.permutations-combinations.combinations.9002",
      "type": "mcq_single",
      "concepts": [
        {
          "id": "math.permutations-combinations.combinations.core.combinations-ncr",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "exam_styles": [
        "jee-main"
      ],
      "stem": {
        "en": "The number of elements in the set $S=\\left\\{(r,k) : k \\in \\mathbf{Z} \\text{ and } {}^{36}C_{r+1}=\\frac{6\\left({}^{35}C_r\\right)}{\\left(k^2-3\\right)}\\right\\}$, is :",
        "hi": "समुच्चय $S=\\left\\{(r,k) : k \\in \\mathbf{Z} \\text{ and } {}^{36}C_{r+1}=\\frac{6\\left({}^{35}C_r\\right)}{\\left(k^2-3\\right)}\\right\\}$ में अवयवों की संख्या है :"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "en": "$2$",
            "hi": "$2$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "en": "$4$",
            "hi": "$4$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "en": "$8$",
            "hi": "$8$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": {
            "en": "$16$",
            "hi": "$16$"
          }
        }
      ],
      "answer": {
        "option_ids": [
          "b"
        ]
      },
      "solution": {
        "feynman": {
          "en": "Rewrite ${}^{36}C_{r+1}$ in terms of ${}^{35}C_r$; the equation then ties $r+1$ to $k^2$. Only a few integer $k$ keep $r$ inside $0$ to $35$.",
          "hi": "${}^{36}C_{r+1}$ को ${}^{35}C_r$ के रूप में लिखिए; तब समीकरण $r+1$ को $k^2$ से जोड़ता है। केवल कुछ पूर्णांक $k$ ही $r$ को $0$ से $35$ के भीतर रखते हैं।"
        },
        "steps": [
          {
            "en": "${}^{36}C_{r+1}=\\frac{36}{r+1}\\,{}^{35}C_r$, so $\\frac{36}{r+1}=\\frac{6}{k^2-3}$, that is $r+1=6(k^2-3)$.",
            "hi": "${}^{36}C_{r+1}=\\frac{36}{r+1}\\,{}^{35}C_r$, अतः $\\frac{36}{r+1}=\\frac{6}{k^2-3}$, अर्थात् $r+1=6(k^2-3)$।"
          },
          {
            "en": "Since $1 \\le r+1 \\le 36$, $k^2-3 \\in \\{1,\\dots,6\\}$, so $k^2=4$ or $k^2=9$.",
            "hi": "क्योंकि $1 \\le r+1 \\le 36$, $k^2-3 \\in \\{1,\\dots,6\\}$, अतः $k^2=4$ या $k^2=9$।"
          },
          {
            "en": "$k=\\pm2$ gives $r=5$; $k=\\pm3$ gives $r=35$. So $S$ has $4$ elements.",
            "hi": "$k=\\pm2$ से $r=5$; $k=\\pm3$ से $r=35$। अतः $S$ में $4$ अवयव हैं।"
          }
        ],
